<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{view}}" class="head">
    <view class="title">{{view.label}} · {{view.mealDate}}</view>
    <view class="muted">已备 {{readyCount}} / {{view.items.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{view && view.items.length}}" class="card list">
    <view
      wx:for="{{view.items}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="row {{item.isReady ? 'ready' : ''}}"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onToggle"
    >
      <view class="check {{item.isReady ? 'on' : ''}}">{{item.isReady ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="name">{{item.ingredientName}}</view>
      <view class="qty">{{item.quantity}}{{item.unit}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{view && !view.items.length}}" class="placeholder">
    这餐还没有已提交的点菜，确认菜单后再来看采购清单
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">加载中…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{view}}" class="muted tip">用量按「点菜份数 ÷ 菜谱基准份数」换算后合并，仅供采买参考</view>
</view>
